{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_27ec768133466b800cbb7e200de2985e57d61ccea8d9be4c505d5c466a0bb13b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_38a801ab99609f208c4fe687c0f3e6af589dcda52bad1df0a6735a8f6acc1a7a","slc_78a1e7ad7e4b6ba1917f4f87736018664ba91cf5a581cdf569c2b9460b3359e9","slc_e76f7108156dd2d9bd4e0638d708441771f0a30c5edc0f9d04b1a48cf24541c6","slc_ebbac6d952b5ddc513c63ea01818d952f9897ea60fd9e75fbf8c0fc42993f03c"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"Running 'vogte -generate-context' writes a vogte-context.txt file in the current directory, and -dir lets users analyze a project in another directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.5,"id":"clm_4b17e5d9ba469efa89c3e27ce21ed9e50d8c3a4d6305961ad18a846e27f87c93","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=inference; facet=interfaces","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2650c35a81780e3b7c6c6e17f7a96565dabee42519e42943990e3730d78c53de","slc_e76f7108156dd2d9bd4e0638d708441771f0a30c5edc0f9d04b1a48cf24541c6"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"The -review flag appears to perform a local LLM review of uncommitted changes against a base branch (default main), optionally accepting a change description message.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7e5d6ac3be06728a0e2d444a78812ac28fa9f123381d51eb26d69a8eec4358bd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_23ea85aa639274078ae574ae93bb4f24dc3473c7b155827b58c0d21262c1e20f","slc_cd8c9cbd884d767239beba20ea16b552888b89b088ef8baf7ecdcf7c370e56a7"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"Vogte is described as an agentic terminal tool aimed at existing Go codebases, helping developers build and maintain Go projects with LLMs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8f989390f23016d3adbf3de8a2799ba83d9138a9c74cdf28d00c413c83a841b0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4d77e26093d373c07990451cb770f0ed01c104b1229cc56cb03c89af619122a0","slc_5ecf51931f73c5bb5be2b0e68573ed76e4c839e6e8b4cf56cbc9ae316ad62c27"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"Installation is via 'go install github.com/piqoni/vogte@latest'; the TUI exits via Ctrl+C or typing q, quite, or exit.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ab954c665c09aeacbdda48e27808afc9fdaa6d9a022fbc1237eb1c0ce56af530","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cd8c9cbd884d767239beba20ea16b552888b89b088ef8baf7ecdcf7c370e56a7"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"Because the language is assumed to be Go, the tool parses repositories with Abstract Syntax Trees to extract compressed, relevant context for LLM prompts, aiming for near-zero configuration.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b15b3a0acc12cfb42cd406210c022500552442ab28ae63bb377666e6e94740a1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e4ed103fed3dd585d7381c5656fa547e1d22c328f107a6920e499344ead4fbb1"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"In agent mode (via -agent or the AGENT toggle) the tool edits files without user approval, and users are advised to rely on version control to avoid losing work.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b92079fc233fee9e64deafadc83644f693358bd05878d83d92bda697ca0c43ee","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c0cb4097ebbf2c99f534e9dc9dceb4c5e837a179847b8173cc4b24fd984c075e"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"After applying patches, the tool runs a 'Sanity Check' (currently 'go vet ./...') and shows a project-health indicator for instant feedback.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c8105f4f84e272cd463128a7920be5169e0abf5915b10566cfdb252b4ddde941","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_329ad614439fe91dcc30f05749975764a20721212f24849f5fe70ea034c70bd8"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"Each message is treated as a new, unrelated chat, and there is no agentic retry loop on failure, at least for now.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_df6d86b6ac9992c779e04358c3d92ade1a62c15f15f0c80684f9a29a0250e8ef","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8c76d53f544003a7484ab8d26ccaddd3bc22674c84203343d632852b85e3aef9","slc_c0cb4097ebbf2c99f534e9dc9dceb4c5e837a179847b8173cc4b24fd984c075e"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"It works with OpenAI-compatible APIs (tested with GPT-4 and Claude Sonnet), supports AWS Bedrock for Anthropic models, and uses OPENAI_API_KEY or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY environment variables.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f3718b27617026f67795f182acf1b56d516be18b29935004a2fbcdd672b7eec9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"piqoni/vogte@37e9ab501aa7 snapshot 40c3abfc06915167","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cd6b15587329d62e736811776e6eb7864953064b834a35873362d81dee924dd7"],"source_ids":["src_eef05b8e4d5851b887c4bc5c5748b2fb"],"text":"It uses a two-step flow: first it extracts structs/interfaces/methods signatures and asks the LLM which files are needed, then supplies those files in full so the LLM can produce a solution.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ff79b1a2d2ed43228fae7fe75e1057ab"}
